"""Public, bilingual Yellowstone and Grand Teton field guides."""
from html import escape as e
import json
T={}
def t(zh,en):T[zh]=en;return zh
TITLE=t('黃石與大提頓四日路線','Yellowstone & Grand Teton: a four-day route')
YN=t('黃石','Yellowstone'); GN=t('大提頓','Grand Teton')
INTRO=t('火山高原、彩色熱泉與斷層山脈。以 Bozeman 進出，串聯黃石與大提頓；用車程、短步道與遊客中心，讀懂兩座相鄰卻很不同的公園。','Volcanic plateaus, colorful hot springs and fault-block mountains. Start and finish in Bozeman, linking two neighboring yet very different parks through scenic drives, short trails and visitor centers.')
# Each stop has its own real photograph, formation story and practical visit notes.
STOPS=[
('fountain-paint-pot',t('噴泉彩繪泥鍋','Fountain Paint Pot'),t('同一條木棧道可以觀察泥鍋、熱泉、間歇泉與噴氣孔。地下熱水與酸性作用讓岩石分解成黏土；水量改變時，泥漿的稠度與冒泡景象也會不同。','One boardwalk introduces mudpots, hot springs, geysers and fumaroles. Heated water and acidic processes break rock into clay; changing water levels alter the bubbling mud.'),t('預留 30–45 分鐘。步道有坡道與階梯；只走指定棧道，不能靠近池邊或跨越護欄。','Allow 30–45 minutes. The route has slopes and stairs. Stay on designated boardwalks and behind barriers.')),
('old-faithful',t('老忠實噴泉與上間歇泉盆地','Old Faithful & Upper Geyser Basin'),t('地下水受熱、壓力累積，再沿通道噴出；老忠實的特色是相對可預測，並不是固定每小時演出。先到遊客教育中心看最新預測，再決定散步順序。','Groundwater heats, pressure builds and water erupts through underground passages. Old Faithful is relatively predictable, not an hourly show. Check the current prediction at the visitor education center before choosing your walk.'),t('基本停留抓 60–90 分鐘，噴發等待時間另有變動。Morning Glory Pool 是延伸步行：官方由 Lower General Store 起算的鋪面路線往返約 2 英里，不能當成看台旁順便到的池子。','Allow 60–90 minutes for a basic visit, with variable eruption waiting time. Morning Glory Pool is an extension: the official paved route from the Lower General Store is about two miles round trip, not a pool beside the viewing benches.')),
('grand-prismatic',t('大稜鏡溫泉觀景步道','Grand Prismatic Spring Overlook'),t('深藍色泉心與橙黃色邊緣來自水深、光線，以及適應不同溫度的微生物群落。從高處看能讀出色帶與盆地的形狀；蒸氣、風與氣溫會影響視野。','The deep-blue center and orange-yellow margins reflect water depth, light and microbial communities adapted to different temperatures. The overlook reveals the bands and basin shape; steam, wind and temperature affect visibility.'),t('由 Fairy Falls 停車區出發，往返約 1.9 公里、爬升約 32 公尺，預留 1–2 小時。與 Midway Geyser Basin 木棧道不同入口，不保證有停車位。','Start at Fairy Falls parking: about 1.9 km round trip and 32 m of elevation gain. Allow 1–2 hours. This uses a different entrance from the Midway Geyser Basin boardwalk; parking is not guaranteed.')),
('west-thumb',t('西拇指間歇泉盆地','West Thumb Geyser Basin'),t('熱泉緊鄰黃石湖，將火山活動與高原湖泊放在同一幅畫面裡。Abyss Pool 的深色泉水和湖邊 Fishing Cone，適合比較水、熱與岩石的關係。','Hot springs sit beside Yellowstone Lake, bringing volcanic activity and an alpine lake into one scene. Abyss Pool and lakeside Fishing Cone illustrate the relationships between water, heat and rock.'),t('安排約 30–45 分鐘短走；若當天要往大提頓，這裡是檢查剩餘車程與回程時間的決策點。','Allow roughly 30–45 minutes for a short walk. If continuing to Grand Teton, reassess the remaining drive and return deadline here.')),
('mud-volcano',t('泥火山與龍口泉','Mud Volcano & Dragon’s Mouth Spring'),t('酸性熱水、氣體與岩石作用，形成泥漿與噴氣景觀。龍口泉的聲響來自水與氣體在洞口湧動；並不是正在噴出熔岩的火山口。','Acidic hot water, gases and rock interact to create muddy pools and steaming features. Dragon’s Mouth sounds come from water and gases surging inside the opening, not erupting lava.'),t('較短停留可看靠近入口的景點；走完整圈會有坡度。從大提頓晚歸時列為可略過停留，不壓縮吃飯與休息。','A brief visit can focus on features near the entrance; the full loop has slopes. Skip this stop on a late return from Grand Teton rather than sacrificing dinner and rest.')),
('hayden',t('海登谷','Hayden Valley'),t('寬闊草地、濕地與黃石河呈現高原生態系，常被用作觀察野生動物的區域。觀景的價值也包括河道與開闊地景，不必只盯著是否看見熊。','Open grasslands, wetlands and the Yellowstone River reveal the plateau ecosystem. This is a wildlife-viewing area, but the river and broad landscape are rewarding even without a bear sighting.'),t('在合法停車區遠觀，勿停在車道上。野生動物出現不保證；與熊、狼至少保持 100 碼，其他野生動物至少 25 碼。','Watch from legal pullouts, never the traffic lane. Wildlife sightings are not guaranteed. Stay at least 100 yards from bears and wolves and 25 yards from other wildlife.')),
('lamar',t('拉馬爾谷與清晨觀獸','Lamar Valley & morning wildlife watching'),t('河谷、草地和山坡讓大型動物有覓食與移動空間。導覽的重點是解讀棲地、遠距觀察與尋找線索，不是追近動物拍照。','River corridors, grasslands and slopes provide feeding and movement space for large mammals. A guided outing emphasizes habitat, distant observation and signs of wildlife, not close approaches.'),t('Morning with the Wild Things 由 Canyon 區指定集合點出發，約 5 小時 15 分。季節不同，報到約 06:15–07:00、返回約 11:30–12:15；以訂單確認為準。業者列有簡單早餐，車型以當期安排為準。','Morning with the Wild Things departs from the designated Canyon-area meeting point and lasts about 5 hours 15 minutes. Seasonal check-in is roughly 06:15–07:00, returning around 11:30–12:15; follow your booking. The operator lists a light breakfast; vehicles follow current arrangements.')),
('yellowstone-canyon',t('黃石大峽谷與 Artist Point','Grand Canyon of the Yellowstone & Artist Point'),t('黃石河切穿受熱液改變的火山岩，形成色彩鮮明的峽谷與瀑布。Artist Point 是看下瀑布與峽谷構圖的經典位置；南北緣角度不同，移動需要開車。','The Yellowstone River cut through hydrothermally altered volcanic rock, creating a colorful canyon and waterfalls. Artist Point offers a classic Lower Falls composition. North and south rim viewpoints have different angles and require driving between them.'),t('以 Artist Point 搭配北緣一至兩處觀景點，留約 1.5–2 小時。Brink of Lower Falls 雖僅往返約 1.1 公里，卻有約 180 公尺高差，回程費力，不能視為輕鬆短走。','Allow 1.5–2 hours for Artist Point and one or two north-rim overlooks. Brink of Lower Falls is only about 1.1 km round trip but descends around 180 m; the climb back is strenuous, not an easy stroll.')),
('norris',t('諾里斯間歇泉盆地','Norris Geyser Basin'),t('這片活躍熱區有乳白色盆地、蒸氣與色彩細節。Porcelain Basin 與 Back Basin 是不同環線；Steamboat Geyser 在 Back Basin，大噴發無法依時刻表等候。','This active thermal area combines pale basins, steam and fine color patterns. Porcelain Basin and Back Basin are separate loops. Steamboat Geyser is in Back Basin and major eruptions cannot be scheduled.'),t('Porcelain 約 1.2 公里，Back Basin 約 2.4 公里。90 分鐘選一圈或精選部分；若加博物館、Artists Paintpots，需再留時間並確認開放。','Porcelain is about 1.2 km and Back Basin about 2.4 km. In 90 minutes, choose one loop or selected sections. Museums and the separate Artists Paintpots trail require extra time and opening checks.')),
('mammoth',t('猛獁熱泉與 Albright 遊客中心','Mammoth Hot Springs & Albright Visitor Center'),t('富含礦物質的熱水流出後沉積碳酸鈣，形成層層石灰華台地。水流位置變動，顏色與活躍區域也會改變；乾燥白色台地同樣是地景的一部分。','Mineral-rich hot water deposits calcium carbonate, building travertine terraces. Flow paths shift, changing active areas and colors; dry white terraces are also part of the landscape.'),t('選下層木棧道短走，或在季節開放時走 Upper Terrace Drive。再到 Albright 看展、詢問蓋章與 Junior Ranger 審核；大型車不可使用上層車道。','Choose a short lower-boardwalk walk or the seasonal Upper Terrace Drive. Visit Albright for exhibits, passport stamps and Junior Ranger review. Large vehicles are not permitted on the upper drive.')),
('roosevelt-arch',t('羅斯福拱門與 Gardiner','Roosevelt Arch & Gardiner'),t('北入口的石造拱門象徵早期公園旅遊與公共保育理念。Gardiner 是離園後用餐、補給的銜接點，適合在回 Bozeman 前留一段緩衝。','The stone arch at the north entrance reflects early park tourism and public conservation ideals. Gardiner is a useful meal and supply stop before returning to Bozeman.'),t('拱門留約 15–20 分鐘拍照，再安排午餐。回機場還需加油、還車與報到，勿把公路車程直接當成登機前剩餘時間。','Allow about 15–20 minutes at the arch, then lunch. Add refueling, rental return and airport check-in time; driving time alone is not an adequate flight buffer.')),
('colter-bay',t('Colter Bay 與遊客中心','Colter Bay & visitor center'),t('傑克森湖岸的森林與港灣，提供觀看提頓山脈的北側入口。先看展覽和湖岸，再決定南下深度，比急著追完每個拍照點更容易掌握時間。','Forested shores and sheltered bays on Jackson Lake form a northern introduction to the Tetons. Start with exhibits and lakeside views, then decide how far south to continue.'),t('短訪留約 30–45 分鐘；遊客中心季節開放。可詢問公園資訊與徽章流程，並確認當日櫃檯服務時間。','Allow roughly 30–45 minutes for a short visit. The visitor center is seasonal; ask about park information, badges and that day’s desk hours.')),
('jackson-lake-dam',t('傑克森湖水壩','Jackson Lake Dam'),t('冰川塑造湖盆，現代水壩又改變了水位管理。湖水、山壁與出水口讓人同時看到自然地形與人類使用水資源的方式。','Glaciers shaped the lake basin, while the modern dam changed water-level management. Water, mountain faces and the outlet show natural landforms alongside human water use.'),t('適合約 15–20 分鐘的路邊短停；在合法停車點下車，勿在道路或水壩設施區任意停留。','A roughly 15–20-minute roadside stop works well. Use legal parking and respect road and dam facility restrictions.')),
('oxbow-bend',t('蛇河牛軛灣','Oxbow Bend'),t('蛇河彎曲的水道與遠方山峰，是大提頓著名的河谷構圖。平靜時可能有倒影，風起或水位改變時則呈現另一種表情。','A bend in the Snake River frames distant peaks in a classic Teton landscape. Calm conditions may produce reflections; wind and water levels change the scene.'),t('留約 15–30 分鐘遠觀與拍照；倒影與動物都不保證。若當晚需回 Canyon，這裡可作為折返前的最後一站。','Allow roughly 15–30 minutes for views and photos. Reflections and wildlife are not guaranteed. This can be the last stop before turning north for a night in Canyon.')),
('jenny-lake',t('珍妮湖與遊客中心','Jenny Lake & visitor center'),t('山谷冰川挖蝕與搬運碎石，留下湖盆與冰磧地形。近距離看山腳、湖面與森林，能補上公路遠眺看不到的尺度。','Valley glaciers eroded basins and moved debris, leaving the lake and moraines. Close views of the mountain base, water and forest offer a different scale from highway overlooks.'),t('Discovery Trail 鋪面短線約 0.56 公里。30–45 分鐘只安排湖邊與遊客中心；搭船到 Hidden Falls 或 Inspiration Point 要另留數小時，不能塞入同一短停。','The paved Discovery Trail is about 0.56 km. A 30–45-minute visit covers only the lakeshore and visitor center. A boat outing to Hidden Falls or Inspiration Point needs several additional hours.')),
('mormon-row',t('摩門歷史聚落','Mormon Row Historic District'),t('草地上的歷史穀倉與提頓山脈構成經典畫面，也記錄早期農牧聚落的生活。照片中的建築不是公園自然形成的一部分，而是文化景觀。','Historic barns set against the Tetons create an iconic composition and record the lives of early farming communities. These buildings are part of a cultural landscape, not natural formations.'),t('留約 30–45 分鐘，依道路與停車狀況調整。這是偏南側的延伸點；當日從黃石往返又要早回住宿區，建議另留一天。','Allow roughly 30–45 minutes, adjusting for road and parking conditions. This is a southern extension; if returning to Yellowstone the same day, save it for an additional day.')),
]
SOURCES=[('NPS · Yellowstone driving times','https://www.nps.gov/yell/planyourvisit/directions.htm'),('NPS · Yellowstone current conditions','https://www.nps.gov/yell/planyourvisit/conditions.htm'),('NPS · Grand Teton','https://www.nps.gov/grte/planyourvisit/index.htm'),('Morning with the Wild Things','https://www.yellowstonenationalparklodges.com/adventure/land-adventures/morning-with-the-wild-things/'),('NPS · Grand Prismatic Overlook','https://www.nps.gov/thingstodo/yell-trail-grand-prismatic-overlook.htm'),('NPS · Norris','https://www.nps.gov/yell/planyourvisit/norrisplan.htm'),('NPS · Jenny Lake','https://www.nps.gov/grte/planyourvisit/jennylakeplan.htm'),('NPS · Yellowstone Junior Ranger','https://www.nps.gov/yell/learn/kidsyouth/junior-ranger.htm'),('NPS · Grand Teton Junior Ranger','https://www.nps.gov/grte/learn/kidsyouth/beajuniorranger.htm')]
def render(ROOT,D,head):
 manifest=json.loads((D/'assets/yellowstone/manifest.json').read_text())
 def photo(k):
  m=manifest[k];t(m['alt_zh'],m['alt_en'])
  label=t('點開高解析照片','Open the high-resolution photo')
  return f'<figure class="hires-photo"><a class="photo-full" href="../../{m["file"]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{label}"><img src="../../{m["file"]}" alt="{e(m["alt_zh"])}" width="{m["width"]}" height="{m["height"]}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption><a href="{e(m["source"])}">{e(m["credit"])}</a> · <a href="../../{m["file"]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{label} ↗</a></figcaption></figure>'

 def base(title,k):
  t(title+'｜公園隨行',T.get(title,title)+' | National Park Field Guide')
  return head(title,'../../')+'<nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="../../index.html">國家公園總覽</a> / <a href="../../routes/yellowstone-grand-teton/">'+TITLE+'</a></nav><section class="park-hero"><div>'+photo(k)+'</div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">WYOMING · MONTANA · IDAHO</p><h1>'+title+'</h1><p>'+INTRO+'</p></div></section>'
 def end():return '<section class="chapter"><h2>'+t('官方資訊與出發前核對','Official information & before you go')+'</h2><p>'+t('本路線適合主要道路開放的季節。時段是規劃參考，未包含所有停車、交通與天氣延誤；出發前確認道路、步道及遊客中心當季開放。','This route is for the season when main roads are open. Times are planning estimates, not guarantees, and do not include every parking, traffic or weather delay. Check seasonal roads, trails and visitor-center hours before departure.')+'</p><div class="refs">'+''.join(f'<a href="{u}">{n} ↗</a>' for n,u in SOURCES)+'</div></section></main><footer><a href="../../index.html">國家公園總覽</a> · <a href="../../routes/yellowstone-grand-teton/">'+TITLE+'</a><p>AI-assisted build · NPS photography</p><p id="offline-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></footer></body></html>'
 for slug,name,stops in [('yellowstone',YN,STOPS[:11]),('grand-teton',GN,STOPS[11:])]:
  s=base(name, 'yellowstone-canyon' if slug=='yellowstone' else 'oxbow-bend')
  s+='<nav class="quick-stops">'+''.join(f'<a href="#{x[0]}">{x[1]}</a>' for x in stops)+'<a href="#visitor-centers">'+t('遊客中心與徽章','Visitor centers & badges')+'</a></nav>'
  s+='<section class="chapter"><h2>'+t('先讀懂這座公園','Understanding this park')+'</h2><p>'+(t('黃石的重點是火山與熱液、河流峽谷，以及廣大的野生動物棲地。不是每一站都要健行：熱泉多用木棧道，峽谷有近停車場的觀景點；但各區距離很遠，移動本身就是行程的一部分。','Yellowstone combines volcanism and hydrothermal activity, river canyons and vast wildlife habitat. Not every stop requires a hike: thermal areas have boardwalks and some canyon overlooks are near parking. Distances between areas are large, so driving is part of the itinerary.') if slug=='yellowstone' else t('提頓斷層造成山地與盆地的相對位移，冰川再雕刻山谷與湖泊。與黃石看熱泉不同，這裡主要看陡峭山峰、湖岸和蛇河。短訪可集中北部湖區；要到 Jenny Lake、Mormon Row 或搭船，最好有獨立的一天。','Movement along the Teton fault displaced the mountains and basin relative to each other; glaciers then carved valleys and lakes. Unlike Yellowstone’s thermal focus, this park centers on steep peaks, lakeshores and the Snake River. A short visit can focus on the northern lake area; Jenny Lake, Mormon Row and boat outings fit better into a separate day.'))+'</p></section>'
  for k,n,story,walk in stops:s+=f'<article class="chapter" id="{k}"><h2>{n}</h2>'+photo(k)+f'<p>{story}</p><p class="schedule-note">{walk}</p></article>'
  s+='<section class="chapter" id="visitor-centers"><h2>'+t('蓋章與 Junior Ranger：先排進營業時間','Passport stamps & Junior Ranger: visit during staffed hours')+'</h2><p>'+(t('黃石可優先安排 Old Faithful Visitor Education Center、Canyon Visitor Education Center 或 Albright Visitor Center。先領取或下載活動冊，完成後在園內由 ranger 審核領徽章；不要假設每一間博物館都有審核服務，也不要只留關門前幾分鐘。','In Yellowstone, prioritize Old Faithful Visitor Education Center, Canyon Visitor Education Center or Albright Visitor Center. Obtain or download the booklet, complete it and have a ranger review it in the park for the badge. Do not assume every museum offers reviews or leave only a few minutes before closing.') if slug=='yellowstone' else t('大提頓可安排 Jenny Lake 或 Colter Bay 遊客中心，確認當季開放與服務時間。Jenny Lake 官方頁列出 Junior Ranger 歡迎所有年齡；完成活動與審核仍需時間，建議把櫃檯停留獨立保留 20–30 分鐘。','In Grand Teton, consider Jenny Lake or Colter Bay visitor centers and check seasonal staffing. Jenny Lake’s official page welcomes all ages to Junior Ranger. Activities and review take time; reserve a separate 20–30-minute desk visit.'))+'</p></section>'
  p=D/'parks'/slug;p.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);(p/'index.html').write_text(s+end())
 s=base(TITLE,'grand-prismatic')
 s+='<section class="schedule-note"><h2>'+t('我們的四日緊湊路線','Our compact four-day journey')+'</h2><p>'+t('我們實際在同一天從西黃石經熱泉區南下大提頓，再返回黃石 Canyon 區過夜，適合天數有限、願意早出晚歸的人參考。下方保留這條實際路線；時段為協助規劃的估計，不是當天精確抵達紀錄。短停與長車程較多，若想悠閒看湖、搭船或健行，建議另排完整一天給大提頓。','We actually traveled from West Yellowstone through the thermal areas to Grand Teton and back to Yellowstone’s Canyon area in one day. This works as a reference for travelers with limited days who accept an early start and late finish. The route below preserves that journey; time bands are planning estimates, not our recorded arrival times. For relaxed lakeside time, a boat outing or hiking, give Grand Teton a full separate day.')+'</p></section>'
 days=[
 (t('Day 1｜Bozeman → 西黃石','Day 1 | Bozeman → West Yellowstone'),'old-faithful',[(t('抵達後','After arrival'),t('領車、補水與採買隔日午餐。預留約 60–90 分鐘，依航班與租車排隊調整。','Collect the rental car, water and next-day picnic supplies. Allow roughly 60–90 minutes, depending on arrival and rental queues.')),(t('午後至傍晚','Afternoon to evening'),t('經 Gallatin Canyon 前往 West Yellowstone，規劃約 2–2.5 小時公路移動，停靠另加。晚抵達就直接用餐休息，不再加園內景點。','Drive through Gallatin Canyon to West Yellowstone. Plan roughly 2–2.5 hours on the road, plus stops. On a late arrival, eat and rest rather than adding park visits.'))]),
 (t('Day 2｜熱泉地景 → 大提頓 → 返回黃石','Day 2 | Thermal basins → Grand Teton → back to Yellowstone'),'west-thumb', [('06:30–08:15',t('西黃石出發，含移動與 Fountain Paint Pot 約 30–45 分鐘短走。若進園排隊，後面景點同步刪減。','Depart West Yellowstone; allow for driving and a 30–45-minute Fountain Paint Pot walk. If entry is delayed, reduce later stops.')),('08:15–09:45',t('移動至 Old Faithful，查看噴發預測、看台與遊客中心。噴發若不順路線時間，選擇等待或保留其他景點；不加 Morning Glory 長走。','Drive to Old Faithful for the prediction, viewing area and visitor center. Choose whether to wait for an eruption or preserve time for later stops. Omit the longer Morning Glory walk.')),('09:45–12:00',t('移動至 Fairy Falls 停車區，大稜鏡觀景步道留 1–2 小時。帶午餐，停車與用餐時間不足就縮減南下範圍。','Drive to Fairy Falls parking and allow 1–2 hours for the Grand Prismatic overlook. Bring lunch; reduce the southbound route if parking or lunch takes longer.')),('12:00–13:30',t('移動至 West Thumb，湖邊木棧道短走與午餐緩衝。此時再次估算南下及晚間返程，太晚就改留黃石湖區。','Drive to West Thumb for a short lakeside boardwalk walk and lunch buffer. Reassess the southbound and evening return drive; stay in the Yellowstone Lake area if running late.')),('13:30–15:30',t('南下大提頓，串聯 Colter Bay、Jackson Lake Dam 與 Oxbow Bend，以短停看湖、山脈和蛇河。這是長距離移動加上快速遊覽的緊湊段落。','Continue south to Grand Teton, linking Colter Bay, Jackson Lake Dam and Oxbow Bend for brief lake, mountain and river views. This is a compact stretch combining a long drive with quick stops.')),('15:30–17:00',t('Jenny Lake 遊客中心與湖岸短走，再到 Mormon Row 看歷史穀倉。以短訪為主，不含搭船與瀑布健行；若前段延誤，可擇一停留。','Visit Jenny Lake’s visitor center and lakeshore, then Mormon Row’s historic barns. Keep visits brief, without a boat trip or waterfall hike. If delayed, choose one of these stops.')),('17:00–21:00',t('北返黃石，經 West Thumb、Mud Volcano 與 Hayden Valley 前往 Canyon 區。把車程、短停與用餐一起預留；抵達可能更晚，動物塞車與夜間視線會增加開車負擔。時間估計不保證每站都能完整停留。','Return north through West Thumb, Mud Volcano and Hayden Valley toward Canyon. Allow for the drive, brief stops and food; arrival may be later. Wildlife traffic and darkness make driving more demanding. These estimates do not guarantee a full stop everywhere.'))]),
 (t('Day 3｜Lamar 觀獸 → 黃石峽谷 → Norris','Day 3 | Lamar wildlife → Yellowstone canyon → Norris'),'lamar',[('06:15–11:30',t('以初夏班次示意：Morning with the Wild Things 清晨觀獸。需提前預訂；其他月份出發可能較晚，午后安排跟著順延。','An early-summer example: Morning with the Wild Things wildlife outing. Reserve ahead. Other months may start later, shifting the afternoon accordingly.')),('11:30–13:00',t('Canyon 區午餐與遊客教育中心，安排展覽、蓋章及活動冊審核。','Lunch in the Canyon area, then the visitor education center for exhibits, stamps and booklet review.')),('13:00–15:00',t('Artist Point 與北緣一至兩個觀景點。選短走，不加陡降的 Brink of Lower Falls。','Artist Point and one or two north-rim overlooks. Choose short walks and omit the steep Brink of Lower Falls descent.')),('15:00–17:30',t('開車約 30 分鐘至 Norris，選 Porcelain 或 Back Basin 的部分步道。完整兩圈、博物館與 Artists Paintpots 不列為同時必到。','Drive roughly 30 minutes to Norris, then choose Porcelain or part of Back Basin. Both full loops, museums and Artists Paintpots are not all required stops.')),('17:30–18:30',t('返回 Canyon 區，晚餐與休息；若仍有餘裕才增加傍晚觀景。','Return to Canyon for dinner and rest, adding evening views only if time and energy allow.'))]),
 (t('Day 4｜Mammoth → Gardiner → Bozeman','Day 4 | Mammoth → Gardiner → Bozeman'),'mammoth',[('08:00–10:00',t('離開 Canyon，經 Norris 前往 Mammoth。若重訪 Artist Point，要計入額外車程與停留，不保證看見彩虹。','Leave Canyon via Norris for Mammoth. A repeat Artist Point visit needs extra driving and stop time; rainbows are not guaranteed.')),('10:00–12:00',t('猛獁熱泉短走、季節開放的 Upper Terrace Drive 與 Albright 遊客中心，依步行需求選擇。','Choose among a Mammoth terrace walk, seasonal Upper Terrace Drive and Albright Visitor Center according to your walking preferences.')),('12:00–13:30',t('經北入口到 Roosevelt Arch 拍照，在 Gardiner 午餐。','Exit north for Roosevelt Arch photos and lunch in Gardiner.')), (t('13:30 起','From 13:30'),t('前往 Bozeman，預留約 2–2.5 小時路程與緩衝，另加加油、還車及航空公司建議報到時間。若班機太早，減少上午停留或多住一晚。','Head to Bozeman, allowing roughly 2–2.5 hours for the road and a buffer, plus fuel, rental return and the airline’s recommended check-in time. With an earlier flight, shorten the morning or stay another night.'))])]
 for i,(title,k,rows) in enumerate(days,1):
  s+=f'<section class="chapter" id="day-{i}"><h2>{title}</h2>'+photo(k)+'<div class="route-schedule">'+''.join(f'<article><strong>{time}</strong><p>{body}</p></article>' for time,body in rows)+'</div></section>'
 s+='<section class="chapter" id="extra-day"><h2>'+t('想把大提頓看完整？留第五天','Want a fuller Teton visit? Add a fifth day')+'</h2><p>'+t('想放慢腳步，可以把第二天南下後改住大提頓或 Jackson 區，隔日用完整一天走 Jenny Lake 湖岸、遊客中心與 Mormon Row，再北返黃石；後續觀獸與北線各順延一天。若搭船健行，再保留半天。這是可選延伸，住宿只列地區，所有活動需依季節預約。','For a slower pace, stay in the Grand Teton or Jackson area after heading south on day two. Give the next full day to Jenny Lake’s shore and visitor center plus Mormon Row, then return north to Yellowstone. Shift wildlife and the northern route by one day. Reserve another half day for a boat-and-hike outing. This is an optional extension; lodging is listed by area and seasonal activities need reservations.')+'</p><div class="quick-stops"><a href="../../parks/yellowstone/">'+YN+'</a><a href="../../parks/grand-teton/">'+GN+'</a></div></section>'
 p=D/'routes/yellowstone-grand-teton';p.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);(p/'index.html').write_text(s+end())
